Based on the provided architecture plan, here is the **Phase 0 (Seams)** implementation checklist and code structure. This phase focuses on proving the core abstractions (Backend trait, Kernel Registry, C ABI, Recipe Loader) and establishing the accuracy baseline on `cpu-ref` and `cuda`.

### 1. Repository Structure (Phase 0 Focus)

```text
crates/
  intarsia-core/
    src/
      lib.rs
      backend.rs          # Backend trait, DeviceInfo, Buffer, StreamId
      registry.rs         # KernelRegistry, KernelImpl, AdmissionTest
      plan.rs             # PlanCompiler, OpGraph
      telemetry.rs        # TelemetrySnapshot
      ops.rs              # Op definitions (Matmul, RmsNorm, etc.)
      quant/
        mod.rs            # QuantFormat trait
        bf16.rs
        fp8.rs
        nvfp4
